Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:09:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1307/3799] soh: rename func_808BCAF0 -> BgTreemouth_WaitForCue

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: watches the cutscene's first actor cue: cue 2 starts a wobble, cue 3 plays the wooden-door sfx and opens the mouth fully. BgTreemouth_WaitForNextCue further down is a byte-identical second copy at its own address.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Treemouth/z_bg_treemouth.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Treemouth/z_bg_treemouth.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Treemouth/z_bg_treemouth.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Treemouth/z_bg_treemouth.c
index e37da3d82..1514962b8 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Treemouth/z_bg_treemouth.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Treemouth/z_bg_treemouth.c
